{"type":"message","id":"606ee9f7","parentId":"552be9cf","timestamp":"2026-04-07T19:03:05.520Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check a few more groups that might have recent activity, and also check some groups not yet mentioned in the tracker:\n\n1. TJ-ai虫洞晨夕会纪要 - likely has activity\n2. TJ-Ai虫洞会员市场核心 - likely has activity  \n3. 虫洞一组总经理沟通群 - likely has activity\n\nLet me also check the newly discovered groups. The 3AM scan found:\n- TJ-酒店市场外拓 - just auto check-in card, no new content\n- TJ-Ai神灯（虫洞）sop - has content but last update was April 4 (about 4 days ago, not 24h)\n\n\n- TJ-Ai-Ai虫洞ai神灯差评分享汇总群 - has content from April 5 (about 3 days ago)\n\nThe 3AM hour typically sees low activity across most groups. Let me scan through a few other groups that haven't been covered yet to see if there's anything new.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qi8ie97c44zr_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_495cabbd6fb52213865eb88112bf8151","page_size":5,"relative_time":"last_7_days"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qi8ie97c44zr_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_7500629c9641246cfacdd30b1e435bef","page_size":5,"relative_time":"last_7_days"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qi8ie97c44zr_3","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_4a9234b5a29bd6fd1dd950ff8004c87f","page_size":5,"relative_time":"last_24_hours"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qi8ie97c44zr_4","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_4e890ccbd87ec2216e47c009e523676d","page_size":5,"relative_time":"last_24_hours"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":6761,"output":486,"cacheRead":49275,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56522,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","times