{"type":"message","id":"e2f1addf","parentId":"d03e5727","timestamp":"2026-04-07T19:03:48.654Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive picture. Let me analyze the key findings:\n\n**24小时内（4月7日）有新消息的群：**\n\n1. **虫洞一组总经理沟通群** (oc_4e890ccbd87ec2216e47c009e523676d)\n   - 陈广德询问直营店3月份租金差异\n   - 方源兵发送虫洞日报（4.4-4.6）via 晁留柱's account\n   - This was already noted in tracker as having today's messages\n   \n2. **TJ-Ai虫洞-前台迎宾sop作业标准群** (oc_0af27a92a09cae4b4bcfc76c6970d62d) also received the same wormhole daily and weekly reports from 晁留柱 on April 7th, which the tracker already picked up.\n\n3. **TJ-ai虫洞晨夕会纪要群** (oc_8de0ee6c766105ebd6c47bb9c234bcf6) had a video conference on April 7th at 5:30 PM with a shared doc link, and the group was also mentioned by 晁留柱.\n\n4. **TJ-Ai虫洞会员市场核心群** (oc_4a9234b5a29bd6fd1dd950ff8004c87f) received a message from 晁留柱 about task management and lobster collaboration.\n\nLooking at the other groups, the core group for Ai wormhole and the front desk SOP group have both been marked as having today's wormhole daily and weekly reports, and the TJ-ai wormhole morning-evening meeting notes group also had activity today with a video conference and shared doc link.\n\nThe TJ-Ai虫洞会员市场核心群 received a message about task management, and the \"四只龙虾\" (Four Lobsters) collaboration system came up in the April 7 review meeting with a mention of AI big model booking research. I'm also noting the TJ-培训-AI应用群 had some operational content about the weekly core focus tracking system with voice control input design, though the robot was removed from that group. Looking at the 24-hour activity since the 2AM check, I see the wormhole daily report and the video conference link from the morning-evening meeting, which are both substantial updates worth capturing.\n\nThe AI member market core group has a notable message about the 10PM review meeting discussing how to integrate the \"Four Lobsters\" collaboration system, plus there's an incomplete research request about AI models for hotel booking. I should also track the training group's weekly core tracking system with voice control features and concurrent editing setup.\n\nThe wormhole group from the general manager shows a rent difference inquiry for March, and there's more activity to review around the April 5 wormhole daily report with specific cases about guest complaints and room upgrades.\n\nI'm also seeing a critical issue flagged by 晁留柱 about a room swap that almost resulted in a double booking—room 1502 was supposed to move to 1516 but the system didn't update properly when 1516 checked out due to cigarette smell, nearly causing the same room to be assigned twice. Then there's the media coverage angle from April 1 where 27 official media outlets reported on the 330 launch, with suggestions to use these links as supporting materials.\n\nNow I need to organize this into memory files. The core updates for today are the video conference summary from April 7, the new member joining the wormhole update group, and the latest wormhole daily report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I have a comprehensive picture. Let me update the tracker and memory files.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_51u3k0nps2ki_1","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":10,"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-07.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":8843,"output":814,"cacheRead":63163,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72820,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775588610559,"responseId":"chatcmpl-184bc5c8-dc52-4d17-a4f4-1f36bcc7dcf3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"cdd73011","parentId":"e2f1addf","timestamp":"2026-04-07T19:03:48.657Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_51u3k0nps2ki_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 群聊知识积累 (2026-04-07)\n\n---\n\n# 🦞 重要记忆沉淀 (2026-04-07)\n\n## 📚 今日核心知识结晶（3条）\n\n### 1. 德拢集团组织架构4线改革\n- **背景**: 品牌事业部 + 虫洞运营小组并行矩阵式管理\n\n[319 more lines in file. Use offset=11 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775588628656}}
